;HYDROGENS HAVE BEEN ADDED IN THE RIDING POSITIONS. THESE ARE RE-REFINED COORDINATES OF THE PREVIOUS WWPDB SUBMISSION 1TXV. THE STARTING MODEL WAS A 2.4 ANGSTROM STRUCTURE WITH A DIFFERENT BOUND LIGAND. THE MODEL IS REFINED TO LOWER RFREE. ONE SEQUENCE MISTAKE IN THE AIIB SUBUNIT IS CORRECTED. MORE OF BETA SUBUNIT DOMAIN I-EGF1 IS BUILT. MISTAKES IN CARBOHYDRATE ANOMERIC LINKAGES ARE CORRECTED.
;
